<title>USA: Sevier County, Tenn., deal Aaa/VMIG-1 by Moody's.</title>
<headline>Sevier County, Tenn., deal Aaa/VMIG-1 by Moody's.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Feb 27 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating</p>
<p>Announcement As of 02/24/97.</p>
<p>    Issuer		: Sevier Co. Pub. Bldg. Auth. Local</p>
<p>				govt. pub. imp. adjustable rate ser.</p>
<p>				II-A, II-B, II-C, I-D, II-D &amp; III-D</p>
<p>				Bonds dtd. 12-30-96 &amp; ser. IID-1,</p>
<p>				IID-2 &amp; II-D3 dtd. 2-27-97</p>
<p>				(Insurer-AMBAC)</p>
<p>    State		 : TN</p>
<p>    Rating		: Aaa/VMIG 1</p>
<p>    Sale Amount	 : 18,250,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 02/26/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
